{"id":"666439","name":"荠菜炒年糕","author":"清水淡竹","authorId":"8451954","desc":"","cover":"images/666439/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"五花肉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"荠菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"冬笋","amount":"适量"},{"name":"杏鲍菇","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"五花肉切丝。","img":"images/666439/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"荠菜洗净焯水过凉。","img":"images/666439/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"冬笋（已焯水）、胡萝卜、杏鲍菇切丝，荠菜切细，香葱切段。","img":"images/666439/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"年糕切细条。","img":"images/666439/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"五花肉放入锅中，小火煸炒出油。","img":"images/666439/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入葱白、笋丝、胡萝卜，杏鲍菇翻炒均匀。","img":"images/666439/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入荠菜翻炒。","img":"images/666439/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入年糕，加少许水焖烧至年糕软糯。","img":"images/666439/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入葱叶、加盐、蚝油调味炒匀。","img":"images/666439/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/666439/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}